{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1820.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"df7f228eade3b1390bb660ce984ce38e4bfb2ee395b5518b9470561e8dc8cf41","ja":"取材開始！","zh":"采访开始！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1820.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"bea7291f18be9e43669b3dee574e8d6d1ed98e1bdc20b80ac95ff988f3b27597","ja":"真実のアイドルちゃんを知ってもらうには、\nまずは取材です！　地道に足で稼ぎましょう！","zh":"先让大家了解真实的偶像小姐，\n第一步就是采访！踏踏实实靠双腿去跑吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1820.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"a4a226d21fad8ac7cc5943fc8f8ad0901ad297cda9fee5fabf7f2f7e4d37cd99","ja":"記事に書かれちゃったみんなに、\n話を聞きに行くんだね！","zh":"对那些被写进文章里的大家，\n要去听听她们的情况呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1820.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9ca4cd5c556300ee9d836437d7e589a4157186126fec62ee4e9eb0f7a5515280","ja":"はい！　その時の状況を聞いて、\n本当は何があったのか、確かめるのです！","zh":"是的！去问问当时的情况，\n确认究竟发生了什么！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1820.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2085dc355576151a2741bd56b109794140670bb34655360416ce4916dabb0877","ja":"にゃはは♪　なんだか本物の記者になったみたい！\nよーし、それじゃあ、じゃんじゃん取材しちゃお！","zh":"喵哈哈♪ 总觉得好像成了真正的记者！\n好嘞，那就一个接一个地去采访吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1820.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"ec2c754a0d0b2c1bad41bba3662025363121209344be4e9d2e0877fbf9724c56","ja":"あっ、ジュリア！　ちょっといい？\nこの雑誌の記事について聞きたいんだけど……。","zh":"啊，茱莉亚！现在方便吗？\n想问问这本杂志上的报道……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1820.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"aefd3376f00df77f6613f29e6ac4ae8dc3f4f8f828a1ff093897c60cc46f2f4e","ja":"記事って……げっ、それかよ！\nそれ、ひとつも合ってないから！　全部でたらめだぞ！","zh":"那篇报道……诶，是那个啊！\n里面一条都没说对！全是瞎编的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1820.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"c3e4af27ebd3df83d6b055ffd5fb191b76b4ff7e8da4030d2f86cf9b36fd54eb","ja":"やっぱりそうなんだ！\nその話、もっと詳しく聞かせてっ！","zh":"果然是这样！\n关于那个，详细跟我说说！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1820.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"6e91d34ef7d4f12c10dd9233b8167c0a3ab273664e7fbb0ec1d569b5af4ec4d9","ja":"歌織さん、麗花ちゃん、\nちょっと、お聞きしたいことがあるのですが……。","zh":"歌织小姐、丽花，\n有点事想请教……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1820.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"043a77551596806bbedc6a6b0645bcfca67286e8e31c3103409d3bcb2f31fef3","ja":"翌日、仕事現場でも……","zh":"次日，工作现场也……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1820.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"c72f0a49699faaaabcf600c08003e0d7c7ed702648b9c8948f62ca89e25d04c0","ja":"より信憑性のある記事を書くために、\n他のアイドルちゃんにも、お話を聞きましょう！","zh":"为了写出更有可信度的报道，\n我们也去采访其他偶像吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1820.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"20d847f5547d8f2cf651d39dfbc2df4c5e7460f595137eb51bd60488fb42e997","ja":"たしかに、記事にされた本人の話だけだと、\nウソついてるって、疑っちゃう人もいそうだね。","zh":"确实，只听报道对象本人的说法，\n似乎也会有人怀疑是在撒谎吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1820.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"5f19ef3dec44471f462b6ede91b65c74764c98c1b74aef366ebb9ef0ff0d52a4","ja":"はい！　ですので、記事の現場にいた\nアイドルちゃんに突撃取材です！","zh":"好的！所以我们要突击采访\n当时在报道现场的偶像！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1820.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"b83940f3677fe5b26e8f792798435a582198f951170cbcd5aa991ce0338569ab","ja":"あっ！　待ってください、そこのアイドルちゃん！\n握手を……ではなく、お聞きしたいことがっ！","zh":"啊！请等一下，那边的偶像小姐！\n握手……不对，是有件事想问您！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
